### 1. Einen neuen Handwerker registrieren
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "matej@handwerker.at",
  "password": "geheim123",
  "firstName": "Matej",
  "lastName": "Deronja",
  "accountType": "PROVIDER"
}

### 2. Mit dem Handwerker einloggen (Token holen)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "matej@handwerker.at",
  "password": "geheim123"
}

### 3. Einen neuen Service (Fensterputzen) anlegen (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": "92a4953a-3cab-4e86-a461-66685a925b82",
  "title": "Fensterputzen Deluxe",
  "description": "Streifenfreie Fenster in ganz Wien",
  "category": "CLEANING",
  "price": 49.0
}

### 4. Alle Services abrufen (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/services